WEBVTT

1
00:02:07.280 --> 00:02:08.720
Wewe ni mpenzi wangu mpya.

2
00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:11.080
Hiyo ni kweli.

3
00:02:11.080 --> 00:02:14.200
Si njia bora ya kukutana na kichwa changu nusu chini ya choo.

4
00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.800
Si hasa sawa na Teddy Daniels, mtu,

5
00:02:16.800 --> 00:02:18.160
Nitawapa hiyo hadithi.

6
00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.920
Hadithi?

7
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:20.920
Nini wewe guys smoking

8
00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.480
huko Portland anyway?

9
00:02:22.480 --> 00:02:23.960
Seattle.

10
00:02:23.960 --> 00:02:28.620
Nilikuja kutoka ofisi katika Seattle.

11
00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.860
Umefanya kazi na maafisa wa polisi kwa muda gani?

12
00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:34.000
Miaka minne.

13
00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.600
Kwa hiyo unajua ni ndogo kiasi gani.

14
00:02:36.600 --> 00:02:38.860
Bila shaka.

15
00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:39.740
Vipi wewe?

16
00:02:39.740 --> 00:02:40.620
Una msichana?

17
00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.620
Mei?

18
00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:56.020
Nilikuwa.

19
00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:57.900
Alikufa.

20
00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:02.380
Yesu, Yesu!

21
00:03:02.380 --> 00:03:05.980
Kulikuwa na moto katika jengo la nyumba wakati nilikuwa kazini.

22
00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:07.860
Watu wanne walikufa.

23
00:03:07.860 --> 00:03:10.900
Kulikuwa na moshi kwamba got yake, si moto, hivyo kwamba ni,

24
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:11.700
hiyo ni muhimu.

25
00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:16.410
Naomba radhi kwa sababu ya sigara.

26
00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:17.330
Oh, ndiyo.

27
00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:18.810
Chukua moja yangu.

28
00:03:18.810 --> 00:03:22.130
Niliweza kuapa walikuwa katika koti langu kabla ya mimi kuja nyumbani.

29
00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:27.360
Wafanyakazi wa serikali wanapotea.

30
00:03:27.360 --> 00:03:29.720
Asante sana.

31
00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.400
Nitakupa taarifa kuhusu taasisi kabla ya kuondoka.

32
00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:36.030
Ninachojua ni kwamba ni hospitali ya akili.

33
00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:39.030
Labda wahalifu wa kichaa.

34
00:03:39.030 --> 00:03:40.430
Naam, kama ni watu tu kukimbia kote,

35
00:03:40.430 --> 00:03:42.670
Na wanaposikia sauti, na wanapo fuatilia vipepeo,

36
00:03:42.670 --> 00:03:43.950
Hawatatuhitaji.

37
00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:56.290
Ni nani wanaoelekea?

38
00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:57.290
Ndiyo, ni kweli.

39
00:03:57.290 --> 00:03:58.450
Upande mwingine wa kisiwa ni

40
00:03:58.450 --> 00:04:02.450
bluffs ya mwamba njia yote chini ya ukingo wa maji.

41
00:04:02.450 --> 00:04:06.930
Dock, ni njia pekee ya kuingia au kutoka.

42
00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.970
Tutaondoka mara tu nyinyi wawili mtakapofika pwani.

43
00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.610
Ningethamini kama ungefanya haraka.

44
00:04:12.610 --> 00:04:13.690
Kwa nini?

45
00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:41.820
Dhoruba inakuja.

46
00:04:41.860 --> 00:04:46.100
Sijawahi kuona badge ya sherifu kabla.

47
00:04:46.100 --> 00:04:48.060
Mimi ni Naibu Ward McPherson, wafalme.

48
00:04:48.060 --> 00:04:49.340
Karibu katika Kisiwa cha Shutter.

49
00:04:49.340 --> 00:05:04.700
Mimi nitakuwa yule ambaye huchukua wewe hadi Ashcliffe.

50
00:05:04.700 --> 00:05:07.620
Wavulana wanaonekana kidogo katika makali, Mheshimiwa McPherson.

51
00:05:07.620 --> 00:06:35.330
Hivi sasa, sherifu, sisi wote ni.

52
00:06:35.330 --> 00:06:38.370
Lakini wakati wa kukaa kwako, utafuata itifaki.

53
00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:39.810
Je, unaelewa?

54
00:06:39.810 --> 00:06:41.650
Bila shaka.

55
00:06:41.650 --> 00:06:44.210
Jengo la matofali nyekundu upande wako wa kulia ni Ward A, mwanamume

56
00:06:44.210 --> 00:06:45.090
Mlinzi.

57
00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:48.530
Ward B, idara ya wanawake, ni moja upande wako wa kushoto.

58
00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:53.250
Ward C ni jengo hilo juu ya bluffs, ngome ya zamani ya Vita vya wenyewe kwa wenyewe.

59
00:06:53.250 --> 00:06:55.730
Wagonjwa hatari zaidi wanaishi huko.

60
00:06:55.730 --> 00:06:57.770
Kuingia katika Ward C ni marufuku

61
00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.530
bila idhini ya kuandika na uwepo wa kimwili

62
00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:03.210
ya mimi na Dk Cawley.

63
00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:05.850
Je, unaelewa?

64
00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:11.180
Unaweza kujifanya kama unavurugika na wazimu.

65
00:07:11.180 --> 00:07:15.980
Kwa njia hii unaombwa kutoa silaha zako za risasi.

66
00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:19.380
Bwana McPherson, sisi ni rasmi kuteuliwa sheriffs wa shirikisho.

67
00:07:19.380 --> 00:07:21.980
Tunatakiwa kubeba silaha zetu za risasi pamoja nasi wakati wote.

68
00:07:22.020 --> 00:07:25.020
Amri ya Utekelezaji 319 ya Kanuni ya Vifungo vya Shirikisho

69
00:07:25.020 --> 00:07:27.180
inasema kwamba wakati ndani ya jela,

70
00:07:27.180 --> 00:07:28.820
ofisi za taasisi hiyo

71
00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:33.460
kuwa na mamlaka ya mwisho.

72
00:07:33.460 --> 00:07:35.020
Wajumbe, hamtaingia kupitia lango hili

73
00:07:35.020 --> 00:07:57.020
na silaha zako za risasi.

74
00:07:57.020 --> 00:07:57.860
- Ni sawa.

75
00:07:57.860 --> 00:08:00.340
Sasa kwa kuwa mambo rasmi yamefanyika, hebu, wavulana.

76
00:08:00.340 --> 00:08:14.380
Je, una maoni gani tusimtafute Dakt. Cawley?

77
00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:15.940
Alitoroka lini?

78
00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.060
Mfungwa huyu.

79
00:08:17.060 --> 00:08:18.300
Ninaogopa Dr Cawley atakuwa

80
00:08:18.300 --> 00:08:20.340
ili kukujulisha hali hiyo.

81
00:08:20.340 --> 00:08:21.300
Mkataba.

82
00:08:21.300 --> 00:08:23.620
Ofisi za kurekebisha katika taasisi ya akili.

83
00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.820
Hiyo ni mtazamo wa ajabu, kama unaweza si vibaya mimi kusema.

84
00:08:25.820 --> 00:08:27.260
Ni kituo pekee cha aina yake

85
00:08:27.260 --> 00:08:29.300
Marekani, hata ulimwengu.

86
00:08:29.300 --> 00:08:30.660
Tunachukua tu hatari zaidi

87
00:08:30.660 --> 00:08:33.940
wagonjwa walioharibiwa, ambao hakuna hospitali nyingine inaweza kusimamia.

88
00:08:33.940 --> 00:08:35.940
Na yote hayo ni kwa sababu ya Dk Cawley.

89
00:08:35.940 --> 00:08:37.820
Ameumba kitu cha kipekee sana hapa.

90
00:08:37.820 --> 00:09:06.130
Ni hospitali kwa watu ambao jamii yetu si tu inaweza fit.

91
00:09:06.130 --> 00:09:09.570
Juu ya darasa lake katika Johns Hopkins na kuwa nayo.

92
00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:14.800
Id, wajumbe.

93
00:09:14.800 --> 00:09:17.000
Onyesha badges yako, wajumbe.

94
00:09:17.000 --> 00:09:20.040
Dr Cawley amekuwa kushauriana mara nyingi na Scotland

95
00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.880
Yard, MI5, OSS.

96
00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:24.640
Kwa nini?

97
00:09:24.640 --> 00:09:27.540
Unamaanisha nini?

98
00:09:27.540 --> 00:09:29.700
Maofisa wa habari wanataka kushauriana na nini

99
00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:30.980
daktari wa akili kuhusu?

100
00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:43.060
Nadhani utakuwa na kumuuliza.

101
00:09:43.060 --> 00:09:43.980
Marshal Daniels?

102
00:09:43.980 --> 00:09:45.580
Daktari.

103
00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:47.580
Marshal Hall.

104
00:09:47.580 --> 00:09:48.580
Asante, Naibu Walden.

105
00:09:48.580 --> 00:09:50.380
Hiyo itakuwa yote.

106
00:09:50.380 --> 00:09:52.020
Ndiyo, bwana.

107
00:09:52.020 --> 00:09:54.740
Ni furaha, wajumbe.

108
00:09:54.740 --> 00:09:56.460
Alikuwa na mengi ya kusema juu yako.

109
00:09:56.460 --> 00:09:57.620
MacPherson ni mtu mzuri.

110
00:09:57.620 --> 00:09:59.700
Yeye anaamini katika kazi tunayofanya hapa.

111
00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:02.180
Na hiyo ingekuwa nini hasa?

112
00:10:02.180 --> 00:10:05.820
Mchanganyiko wa maadili kati ya sheria na utaratibu na huduma za kliniki.

113
00:10:05.820 --> 00:10:06.740
Nisamehe, Daktari.

114
00:10:06.740 --> 00:10:15.890
Ni nini kati ya nini na nini?

115
00:10:15.890 --> 00:10:18.970
Machozi hayo ni sahihi kabisa.

116
00:10:18.970 --> 00:10:21.010
Mara nyingi walikuwa wagonjwa ambao tunashughulika nao hapa

117
00:10:21.010 --> 00:10:24.290
Walifungwa minyororo na kuachwa katika uchafu wao wenyewe.

118
00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:26.570
Walipigwa kama vile kuwapiga kwa damu

119
00:10:26.570 --> 00:10:27.890
ingekuwa kuondoa psychosis.

120
00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:30.090
Tuliendesha screws katika ubongo wao.

121
00:10:30.090 --> 00:10:31.610
Tuliwazamisha katika maji ya barafu.

122
00:10:31.610 --> 00:10:36.570
mpaka walipopoteza ufahamu au hata kuachwa.

123
00:10:36.570 --> 00:10:37.570
Na sasa?

124
00:10:37.570 --> 00:10:38.570
Tunawatunza.

125
00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.890
Jaribu kuponya, jaribu kuponya.

126
00:10:40.890 --> 00:10:42.730
Na kama hiyo kushindwa, angalau sisi kutoa yao

127
00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:45.970
na kiasi fulani cha faraja katika maisha yao, utulivu.

128
00:10:45.970 --> 00:10:49.290
Wote hawa ni watetezi wenye jeuri, sivyo?

129
00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.730
Maana, wamewaumiza watu, wamewaua katika visa fulani.

130
00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:56.170
Katika visa vingi, ndiyo.

131
00:10:56.170 --> 00:10:57.770
Na binafsi, Daktari, ningependa kusema

132
00:10:57.770 --> 00:11:01.990
kuharibu hisia zao utulivu.

133
00:11:01.990 --> 00:11:04.350
Ni kazi yangu kuwatunza wagonjwa wangu, si waathirika wao.

134
00:11:04.350 --> 00:11:05.750
Mimi si hapa kuhukumu.

135
00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:07.830
Hivyo mfungwa huyu mwanamke?

136
00:11:07.830 --> 00:11:09.230
Mvumilivu.

137
00:11:09.270 --> 00:11:11.390
Nisamehe, mgonjwa.

138
00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:16.510
Mmoja, Rachel Solando, alitoroka wakati fulani katika saa 24 zilizopita.

139
00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:18.910
Jana usiku, kati ya saa kumi na nusu usiku.

140
00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:20.550
Je, yeye huonwa kuwa hatari?

141
00:11:20.550 --> 00:11:22.270
Unaweza kusema hivyo.

142
00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:25.070
Aliwaua watoto wake wote watatu.

143
00:11:25.070 --> 00:11:27.990
Aliwazamisha katika ziwa nyuma ya nyumba yake.

144
00:11:27.990 --> 00:11:29.710
Aliwaondoa mmoja mmoja, akaweka vichwa vyao

145
00:11:29.710 --> 00:11:31.390
chini mpaka walipofa.

146
00:11:31.390 --> 00:11:32.630
Kisha akawaleta ndani

147
00:11:32.630 --> 00:11:34.390
na kuziweka karibu na meza ya jikoni.

148
00:11:34.390 --> 00:11:39.650
Alikula chakula hapo kabla jirani hajapita.

149
00:11:39.650 --> 00:11:40.850
Namna gani mume wake?

150
00:11:40.850 --> 00:11:41.810
Alikufa.

151
00:11:41.850 --> 00:11:43.570
Kwenye pwani za Normandy.

152
00:11:43.570 --> 00:11:45.330
Yeye ni mjane wa vita.

153
00:11:45.330 --> 00:11:47.650
Alijiua njaa alipofika hapa.

154
00:11:47.650 --> 00:12:00.420
Alidai kwamba watoto hawakufa.

155
00:12:00.420 --> 00:12:01.580
Sorry, Daktari.

156
00:12:01.580 --> 00:12:03.220
Wewe si kwa bahati mbaya kuwa na aspirin, je, wewe?

157
00:12:03.220 --> 00:12:04.900
Prime ni maumivu ya kichwa, Marshal.

158
00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:07.220
Wakati mwingine, lakini leo mimi ni kidogo zaidi

159
00:12:07.220 --> 00:12:08.340
huwa na ugonjwa wa baharini.

160
00:12:08.340 --> 00:12:10.220
Ah, uharibifu wa maji.

161
00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:11.140
Wewe ni vizuri, bosi?

162
00:12:11.140 --> 00:12:11.940
- Ndiyo, ni kweli.

163
00:12:11.940 --> 00:12:13.260
Katika kesi hiyo, una haki kabisa.

164
00:12:13.260 --> 00:12:14.140
Kadiri ilivyo rahisi, ndivyo ilivyo bora.

165
00:12:14.140 --> 00:12:17.180
Naam, asante sana.

166
00:12:17.180 --> 00:12:20.780
Rachel bado anaamini kwamba watoto hao wako hai.

167
00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:25.870
Pia anaamini mahali hapa ni nyumbani kwake katika Berkshires.

168
00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:26.670
Wewe ni kuwa na furaha.

169
00:12:26.670 --> 00:12:28.070
Yeye kamwe ni mara moja katika miaka miwili

170
00:12:28.070 --> 00:12:29.950
alikiri kwamba yeye ni katika taasisi

171
00:12:29.950 --> 00:12:32.070
Anaamini wote walikuwa waokoaji,

172
00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:33.870
wafugaji wa maziwa, wafanyakazi wa posta.

173
00:12:33.870 --> 00:12:36.150
Ili kudumisha udanganyifu kwamba watoto wake hawakufa,

174
00:12:36.150 --> 00:12:38.350
yeye imejenga elaborate fictional muundo

175
00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:42.630
na yeye anatupa sehemu zote za kucheza katika hiyo fiction.

176
00:12:42.630 --> 00:12:44.750
Hivyo umetafuta ardhi tayari?

177
00:12:44.750 --> 00:12:47.430
Mlinzi na wanaume wake walipiga mwamba kisiwa hicho.

178
00:12:47.430 --> 00:12:49.510
Hakuna alama.

179
00:12:49.510 --> 00:12:51.110
Kinachochanganya zaidi ni kwamba hatujui

180
00:12:51.190 --> 00:12:54.070
jinsi alivyotoka katika chumba chake.

181
00:12:54.070 --> 00:12:57.950
Ilikuwa imefungwa kutoka nje na madirisha pekee yalikuwa yamefungwa.

182
00:12:57.950 --> 00:13:10.140
Ni kana kwamba alivumbua moja kwa moja kupitia kuta.

183
00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:12.580
Alimleta hapa baada ya tiba ya kikundi,

184
00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:15.460
akamfunga ndani, akarudi kwa ajili ya duru ya usiku wa manane,

185
00:13:15.460 --> 00:13:23.770
Alikuwa amekufa.

186
00:13:23.770 --> 00:13:26.450
Kwa kweli, daktari, ni jinsi gani inawezekana kwamba ukweli

187
00:13:26.450 --> 00:13:28.090
kamwe kupata kwa yake?

188
00:13:28.090 --> 00:13:31.090
Namaanisha, yuko katika hospitali ya akili, sivyo?

189
00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:33.330
Inaonekana kama kitu ambacho umegundua mara kwa mara.

190
00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:35.410
Wagonjwa wanapewa viatu vingapi?

191
00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:36.890
Viwili vya jozi.

192
00:13:36.890 --> 00:13:38.610
Upole wa akili si uchaguzi.

193
00:13:38.610 --> 00:13:41.810
Marshall, huwezi kuchagua tu kupata juu yake.

194
00:13:41.810 --> 00:13:43.530
Ni nini kinachoendelea?

195
00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:44.810
Yeye kuondoka hapa miguu uchi?

196
00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:48.610
Hebu, daktari, hakuweza kupata mita 10 katika eneo hilo.

197
00:13:50.050 --> 00:14:10.390
Marshall?

198
00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:12.310
Kwa hakika hii ni maandishi ya Rachel.

199
00:14:12.310 --> 00:14:15.270
Hata hivyo, sijui sheria ni kwa ajili ya nini.

200
00:14:15.270 --> 00:14:16.830
Si neno la kisaikolojia.

201
00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:18.190
Ninaogopa si.

202
00:14:18.190 --> 00:14:19.590
Ni nani aliye na miaka 67?

203
00:14:21.070 --> 00:14:22.190
Je, sijui kama.

204
00:14:22.190 --> 00:14:23.350
Lazima niseme, hiyo ni karibu sana

205
00:14:23.350 --> 00:14:24.710
kwa hitimisho langu kliniki.

206
00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.030
Unafikiri ni tu scribbing random?

207
00:14:28.030 --> 00:14:30.390
Oh, hapana, Rachel ni mwenye akili.

208
00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:31.870
Kwa kweli, ni bora.

209
00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.390
Karatasi hii inaweza kuwa muhimu.

210
00:14:33.390 --> 00:14:35.390
Nisamehe, daktari, lakini sisi ni gonna kuwa

211
00:14:35.390 --> 00:14:39.660
kushikilia hii, bila shaka.

212
00:14:39.660 --> 00:14:42.580
Na wewe kusema yeye alikuwa kuja kupitia hapa?

213
00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:45.940
Baada ya taa kuzimwa, amri ni, kucheza kadi hapa.

214
00:14:46.940 --> 00:14:49.460
Jana usiku, kulikuwa na wanaume saba wakikaa kwenye msingi

215
00:14:49.460 --> 00:14:51.900
ya wale ngazi kucheza stud poker,

216
00:14:51.900 --> 00:14:56.760
lakini kwa njia fulani Rachel aliweza kutoroka.

217
00:14:56.760 --> 00:14:57.720
Jinsi gani?

218
00:14:57.720 --> 00:14:59.000
Yeye kuwa asiyeonekana?

219
00:15:00.200 --> 00:15:02.520
Daktari, tutahitaji kupata faili za wafanyakazi

220
00:15:02.520 --> 00:15:04.480
ya wafanyakazi wote wa matibabu, wauguzi, walinzi,

221
00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:06.440
wauguzi, mtu yeyote ambaye alikuwa akifanya kazi huko.

222
00:15:06.440 --> 00:15:09.280
Tutachukua ombi lako kwa kuzingatia.

223
00:15:09.280 --> 00:15:12.000
Hii si ombi, daktari.

224
00:15:12.000 --> 00:15:14.560
Hii ni kituo cha shirikisho katika gereza hatari.

225
00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.800
Mvumilivu.

226
00:15:15.800 --> 00:15:18.200
Mgonjwa ameponyoka sasa.

227
00:15:18.200 --> 00:15:19.240
Utatii.

